{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Notchet 是一款專為 iPhone 和 iPad 設計的智能剪貼簿管理器，能自動將您複製的文字、連結、圖片及檔案保存為卡片格式，並提供可搜尋的網格介面。此工具適合需要頻繁處理多份資料的用戶，現正推出終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>活動。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-160.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>高效管理與隱私保護</h2>\n<p>Notchet 允許用戶在任意應用內透過專屬鍵盤直接插入已儲存的卡片，支持從截圖中識別文字並搜尋。其特色包括將日常常用內容釘選、創建自動填充日期或簽名的片段，以及建立分類集合。此外，它對 API 密鑰和密碼進行脫敏處理，防止洩露，所有數據均在設備端加密且無需帳戶註冊，確保極致的隱私安全。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-166-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-167-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-168-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-169-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-170-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Notchet: Clipboard Manager 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Notchet: Clipboard Manager</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6821904286\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:09:50.900712+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":450,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T01:02:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:57.537737+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T01:03:22.402393+00:00","content_hash":"e9dc4eb006aace66756c84a87394cf7f85055277ad3b74e89ebd8485e3ec62a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}